OL,3,GNEWSARoad reopens after fire at block
OL,4,Aof flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road has reopened following a fire at
OL,7,Fa block of flats.
OL,9,FHampshire and Isle of Wight Fire and
OL,10,FRescue Service (HIWFRS) said it was
OL,11,Fcalled at about 13:00 BST to a fire
OL,12,Finvolving the stairwell and roof space
OL,13,Fof a block of flats on Garfield Road in
OL,14,FRyde.
OL,16,FHIWFRS said the fire in the stairwell
OL,17,Fhad now been extinguished, with crews
OL,18,Ffrom Newport, Ryde, Shanklin, Cowes,
OL,19,FSandown and Ventnor continuing to damp
OL,20,Fdown the roof space and monitor the
OL,21,Fbuilding.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
