OL,3,GNEWSARoad reopens after fire at block
OL,4,Aof flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary road closure was put in
OL,7,Fplace while crews dealt with the
OL,8,Fincident. In a statement on social
OL,9,Fmedia, Isle of Wight Police advised
OL,10,Fthose who lived in the area to keep
OL,11,Ftheir windows shut.
